  m_Name: Valentines Jellies
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  fishName: Valentines Jellies
  description: "Often called \"Valentines Jellies\" for the distinctive heart-shaped
    pattern on their Bell, and as they are always seen in pairs. They are fatally
    poisonous to every species in the galaxy except the Nyaalines, for whom they
    are only very poisonous.\\n\\n  Chef's Notes:\\nAhh, how nostalgic... I remember
    cooking two of these to my first girlfriend, saute'd with summer onions and served
    over fluffed rice. What a romantic meal... we were deathly ill for a week afterwards
    of course, but then that\u2019s the price of romance."
